{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Sonata_Wishlist_Pop.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Music is our past and future.&quot; Dive into a rich tower-defense RPG inspired by music!  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/UniqueAndLovableCharacters_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Characters.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div>Each character is intricately designed based on different instruments and genres of music. Enjoy their HD splash art in skill cut-ins, alongside adorable chibis on the battlefield.  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/StrategicAndFullOfDepth_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Strategic.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div>10 Musical Genres and 7 Virtuoso Archetypes available at launch. Raise and create your own line-up of Virtuosos, and make the intense real-time combat gameplay yours. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/ExcitingAndTowerDefenseGameplay_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/TD_Gameplay.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div>Test your strategy by deploying Virtuosos to defend against waves of enemies in thrilling tower defense battles. Combine musical abilities and unique archetypes to overcome complex challenges and keep the rhythm alive! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/ComplexWorldbuilding_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Worldbuilding.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div>Enter a detailed world that hides many secrets, and experience a visual novel-styled story that takes you through twists and turns. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/HighQualityBGM_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/BGM.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world based on music, represented by its music. Hear the tracks changing based on your gameplay! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Sonata_Wishlist_Pop.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180780?t=1753501936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/8a40638de1290911bcd4a881dd365431e412d5ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753501936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/d4d75e8cea7d8c19b3422764d5382adf5c59dbc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753501936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/d4d75e8cea7d8c19b3422764d5382adf5c59dbc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753501936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Sonata_Wishlist_Pop.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Music is our past and future.&quot; Dive into a rich tower-defense RPG inspired by music!  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/UniqueAndLovableCharacters_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Characters.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div>Each character is intricately designed based on different instruments and genres of music. Enjoy their HD splash art in skill cut-ins, alongside adorable chibis on the battlefield.  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/StrategicAndFullOfDepth_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Strategic.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div>10 Musical Genres and 7 Virtuoso Archetypes available at launch. Raise and create your own line-up of Virtuosos, and make the intense real-time combat gameplay yours. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/ExcitingAndTowerDefenseGameplay_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/TD_Gameplay.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div>Test your strategy by deploying Virtuosos to defend against waves of enemies in thrilling tower defense battles. Combine musical abilities and unique archetypes to overcome complex challenges and keep the rhythm alive! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/ComplexWorldbuilding_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Worldbuilding.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div>Enter a detailed world that hides many secrets, and experience a visual novel-styled story that takes you through twists and turns. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/HighQualityBGM_Header_NoBG.png?t=1753501936\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/BGM.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world based on music, represented by its music. Hear the tracks changing based on your gameplay! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/Sonata_Wishlist_Pop.gif?t=1753501936\" /></div></p>","developers":["Starpixel Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/a4e9d87cb85e54356cb1462de95e74b235607ca2/header.jpg?t=1753501936","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257048522,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257048522/movie480.mp4?t=1733214329","max":"http://video.ak